vncdotool (2.0.0~dev0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Rework packaging for Python 3: build with dh-python/pybuild against
    python3-hatchling instead of python-support/python-setuptools, drop
    the python-vncdotool-doc package (Sphinx removed upstream), and drop
    the debian/vncdo, debian/vnclog and debian/vncdotool wrapper scripts
    now that pyproject.toml's [project.scripts] installs those entry
    points itself.
  * Bump debhelper compat to 13 (declared via debhelper-compat) and
    source format to "3.0 (quilt)".

 -- Marc Sibson <sibson+vncdotool@gmail.com>  Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0700

